msgctxt "profile"
msgid "About"
msgstr "Info"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:884 src/ui/settings.rs:1940
msgid "Change profile picture"
msgstr "Ubah foto profil"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:885 src/ui/settings.rs:2023 src/ui/settings.rs:2463
msgid "Unlink this computer"
msgstr "Putuskan tautan komputer ini"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:886 src/ui/settings.rs:2034 src/ui/accounts.rs:125
msgid "Add account"
msgstr "Tambah akun"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:887 src/ui/settings.rs:2010
msgid "Remove this account"
msgstr "Hapus akun ini"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:892
msgid "Files"
msgstr "File"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:895
msgid "Open folder"
msgstr "Buka folder"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:897
msgid "Message archive"
msgstr "Arsip pesan"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:915 src/ui/settings.rs:1081
msgid "Downloads"
msgstr "Unduhan"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:928
msgid "Change…"
msgstr "Ubah…"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:940
msgid "Use default"
msgstr "Gunakan default"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:961
msgid "Archive progress"
msgstr "Progres pengarsipan"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:961
msgid ""
"Counts describe saved files and queued work. Unavailable includes oversized "
"files and clips missing recovery keys; it does not prove that WhatsApp has "
"no copy. History responses do not prove the archive is complete."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah menunjukkan file tersimpan dan pekerjaan antrean. Tidak tersedia "
"mencakup file terlalu besar dan klip tanpa kunci pemulihan; ini tidak "
"membuktikan WhatsApp tidak memiliki salinan. Respons riwayat tidak "
"membuktikan arsip sudah lengkap."

#: src/ui/settings.rs:963
#, rust-format
msgid "{count} file downloaded"
msgid_plural "{count} files downloaded"
msgstr[0] "{count} file diunduh"
msgstr[1] "{count} file diunduh"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:964
#, rust-format
msgid "{count} file waiting"
msgid_plural "{count} files waiting"
